## 36. Key point to remember

> The genealogy stayed complete; the historical definition changed.

The sensitivity analysis asked whether the historical contribution estimate changed when the uncertain pre-1973 animal set was defined as:

29 animals  
39 animals  
343 animals

The updated version then evaluated those scenarios against:

1973 cohort  
1944–1997  
1998–2024

The use of 1998–2024 as the post-closure reference population is the key difference between this analysis and the earlier version that used different later-year boundaries.
